# Keep local build trees and exported geometry out of the build context.
# A build/ produced outside Docker (for example a Windows MSVC build) carries a
# CMakeCache pointing at host paths, and the in-container cmake refuses to reuse
# it, so the image build fails. The *.gdml files are run outputs, not sources.
geant/build/
**/*.gdml

# the repo history does not belong in the image context either
.git/
